#: src/app/[lang]/blog/on-device-ai-budget-app-explainer/page.tsx
msgid "Categorization and suggestions take about 1.6 GB of storage. Adding voice entry brings the total to about 2.5 GB. All of it is optional: nothing downloads until you switch On-device AI on in Settings, and then each part arrives the first time you use the feature that needs it. It downloads once — normal use afterwards needs no further download."
